{"content_hash": "ab265fc7784071dd", "version_id": 1022, "article_id": 103, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "AI company Anthropic goes public in the biggest IPO ever", "title_zh": "AI公司Anthropic上市，创下史上最大IPO", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1690375?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620302044902-30315ad936cb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8YW50aHJvcGljJTIwaXBvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTUxNDE3NzJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Annie Spratt on Unsplash", "author": "Annie Spratt", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@anniespratt?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/text-k35mDhjCJ0c?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(143, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(181, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "81ef2143d31f"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-20", "word_count": 142, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "Anthropic, the company behind the Claude AI, just sold shares on the Nasdaq. It raised more money than any company before. But many AI experts are angry about it.", "lead_zh": "开发Claude人工智能的Anthropic刚刚在纳斯达克上市。它筹到的钱比以往任何公司都多。但很多AI专家对此很生气。", "preview": "Anthropic sold 980 million shares at $83 each. The sale raised $81.34 billion, more than SpaceX's record in June. Seven big tech companies, ", "preview_zh": "Anthropic以每股83美元卖出9.8亿股。这次发行筹得813.4亿美元，超过SpaceX六月创下的纪录。英伟达、微软和谷歌等七家科技巨头还额外认购了260亿美元。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1005, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 57.5, "size_bytes": 345888, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 168, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 58.975, "size_bytes": 354816, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 168, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/103/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 63.8, "size_bytes": 383760, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 168, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/103/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 54.425, "size_bytes": 327456, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 168, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/103/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 57.05, "size_bytes": 343296, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 168, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/103/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@6af87068/content/data/versions/1022.json", "paragraphs": ["Anthropic sold 980 million shares at $83 each. The sale raised $81.34 billion, more than SpaceX's record in June. Seven big tech companies, including Nvidia, Microsoft and Google, also bought $26 billion more.", "On the same day, almost 100 top AI researchers and founders signed an open letter. They said Anthropic is not a safe AI company. The signers often disagree, but this time they agree on one thing.", "Anthropic says its AI models help build the next models faster. Its sales grew from $41 million in 2023 to $4.6 billion in 2025. But in its IPO papers, the company also warns that AI could harm society.", "Critics say this is the problem. Anthropic calls itself safe, but it also sells this fast AI growth to investors. Its leaders believe they must win the race, so the right people control AI first."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Anthropic以每股83美元卖出9.8亿股。这次发行筹得813.4亿美元，超过SpaceX六月创下的纪录。英伟达、微软和谷歌等七家科技巨头还额外认购了260亿美元。", "同一天，近百位顶尖AI研究者和创始人签署了一封公开信。他们说Anthropic不是一家安全的AI公司。这些签名者平时常常意见不合，但这次他们在一件事上达成一致。", "Anthropic说，它的AI模型能帮助更快地造出下一代模型。公司收入从2023年的4100万美元增长到2025年的46亿美元。但在上市文件里，公司也警告AI可能危害社会。", "批评者说问题就在这里。Anthropic自称安全，却又把这种AI的快速进步卖给投资者。公司高层相信必须赢下这场竞赛，好让“好人”先控制AI。"], "body": "Anthropic sold 980 million shares at $83 each. The sale raised $81.34 billion, more than SpaceX's record in June. Seven big tech companies, including Nvidia, Microsoft and Google, also bought $26 billion more.\n\nOn the same day, almost 100 top AI researchers and founders signed an open letter. They said Anthropic is not a safe AI company. The signers often disagree, but this time they agree on one thing.\n\nAnthropic says its AI models help build the next models faster. Its sales grew from $41 million in 2023 to $4.6 billion in 2025. But in its IPO papers, the company also warns that AI could harm society.\n\nCritics say this is the problem. Anthropic calls itself safe, but it also sells this fast AI growth to investors. Its leaders believe they must win the race, so the right people control AI first.", "body_zh": "Anthropic以每股83美元卖出9.8亿股。这次发行筹得813.4亿美元，超过SpaceX六月创下的纪录。英伟达、微软和谷歌等七家科技巨头还额外认购了260亿美元。\n\n同一天，近百位顶尖AI研究者和创始人签署了一封公开信。他们说Anthropic不是一家安全的AI公司。这些签名者平时常常意见不合，但这次他们在一件事上达成一致。\n\nAnthropic说，它的AI模型能帮助更快地造出下一代模型。公司收入从2023年的4100万美元增长到2025年的46亿美元。但在上市文件里，公司也警告AI可能危害社会。\n\n批评者说问题就在这里。Anthropic自称安全，却又把这种AI的快速进步卖给投资者。公司高层相信必须赢下这场竞赛，好让“好人”先控制AI。", "text": "Anthropic sold 980 million shares at $83 each. The sale raised $81.34 billion, more than SpaceX's record in June. Seven big tech companies, including Nvidia, Microsoft and Google, also bought $26 billion more. On the same day, almost 100 top AI researchers and founders signed an open letter. They said Anthropic is not a safe AI company. The signers often disagree, but this time they agree on one thing. Anthropic says its AI models help build the next models faster. Its sales grew from $41 million in 2023 to $4.6 billion in 2025. But in its IPO papers, the company also warns that AI could harm society. Critics say this is the problem. Anthropic calls itself safe, but it also sells this fast AI growth to investors. Its leaders believe they must win the race, so the right people control AI first.", "vocab": [{"word": "go public", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "上市", "note": "指公司首次向公众卖股票", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "share", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股票；股份", "note": "常用复数 shares", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "raise money", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "筹钱", "note": "raise 也可表示“提高”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "record", "pos": "noun", "zh": "纪录", "note": "break a record 打破纪录", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "researcher", "pos": "noun", "zh": "研究者", "note": "research 是“研究”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sign", "pos": "verb", "zh": "签署", "note": "sign a letter 签署一封信", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "safe", "pos": "adj", "zh": "安全的", "note": "反义词 dangerous", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "warn", "pos": "verb", "zh": "警告", "note": "warn that... 警告说……", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T02:29:30.365050", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Anthropic", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.85, "sm": 325, "em": 849, "cs": 0, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "sold", "s": 0.85, "e": 1.125, "sm": 850, "em": 1125, "cs": 10, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "980", "s": 1.125, "e": 1.9, "sm": 1125, "em": 1899, "cs": 15, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "million", "s": 1.9, "e": 2.288, "sm": 1900, "em": 2287, "cs": 19, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "shares", "s": 2.288, "e": 2.675, "sm": 2287, "em": 2674, "cs": 27, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "at", "s": 2.675, "e": 2.812, "sm": 2675, "em": 2812, "cs": 34, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i